From db9cee5b51bdabeb5121269b67e073bb712b5e7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sasheen Rajalingam <sasheenrajalingam@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 03:33:27 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Redesign site around the new monochrome VIHI IT logo

- Vector logo assets (mark, horizontal and stacked lockups, black and white)
  traced from the new artwork, plus favicon, Apple touch icon and social image
- BrandLogo component draws the logo in currentColor for light and dark sections
- Monochrome brand tokens replace the gold palette across the theme and pages
- Archivo, self-hosted via Fontsource: expanded width for headlines to echo the
  wordmark; builds no longer depend on Google Fonts
- New home hero: the logo mark used as a window onto the hero video
- Header combines logo, navigation and contact into one bar; footer is now
  a black panel with the white lockup
- Photography shown in black and white via a single `mono` class
  (portfolio project images stay in colour)
- Card shadows replaced with hairline outlines; all-caps labels removed
- Copy fixes: "Expensive Areas of Expertise", "failored", "Finance Services Services"

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q3AW4qGUqdWUhvfVW37JEy
